{"id":"zhouyi","title":"周易","author":"佚名","category":"jing","description":"《周易》即《易经》，《三易》之一（另有观点：认为易经即三易，而非周易），是传统经典之一，相传系周文王姬昌所作，内容包括《经》和《传》两个部分。《经》主要是六十四卦和三百八十四爻，卦和爻各…本版为全本。","chapters":[{"id":"zhouyi-01","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"乾卦","order":1,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-01-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-01","order":1,"text":"《乾》：元亨，利贞。"},{"id":"zhouyi-01-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-01","order":2,"text":"初九：潜龙勿用。"},{"id":"zhouyi-01-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-01","order":3,"text":"九二：见龙在田，利见大人。"},{"id":"zhouyi-01-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-01","order":4,"text":"九三：君子终日乾乾，夕惕若厉，无咎。"},{"id":"zhouyi-01-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-01","order":5,"text":"九四：或跃在渊，无咎。"},{"id":"zhouyi-01-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-01","order":6,"text":"九五：飞龙在天，利见大人。"},{"id":"zhouyi-01-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-01","order":7,"text":"上九：亢龙有悔。"},{"id":"zhouyi-01-8","chapterId":"zhouyi-01","order":8,"text":"用九：见群龙无首，吉。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-02","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"坤卦","order":2,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-02-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-02","order":1,"text":"《坤》：元亨，利牝马之贞。君子有攸往，先迷后得主，利；西南得朋，东北丧朋，安贞吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-02-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-02","order":2,"text":"初六：履霜，坚冰至。"},{"id":"zhouyi-02-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-02","order":3,"text":"六二：直，方，大；不习，无不利。"},{"id":"zhouyi-02-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-02","order":4,"text":"六三：含章，可贞。或从王事，无成有终。"},{"id":"zhouyi-02-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-02","order":5,"text":"六四：括囊，无咎无誉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-02-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-02","order":6,"text":"六五：黄裳，元吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-02-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-02","order":7,"text":"上六：龙战于野，其血玄黄。"},{"id":"zhouyi-02-8","chapterId":"zhouyi-02","order":8,"text":"用六：利永贞。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-03","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"屯卦","order":3,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-03-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-03","order":1,"text":"《屯》：元亨，利贞。勿用有攸往。利建侯。"},{"id":"zhouyi-03-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-03","order":2,"text":"初九：磐桓。利居贞。利建侯。"},{"id":"zhouyi-03-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-03","order":3,"text":"六二：屯如邅如。乘马班如。匪寇。婚媾。女子贞不字，十年乃字。"},{"id":"zhouyi-03-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-03","order":4,"text":"六三：即鹿无虞，惟入于林中。君子几，不如舍。往，吝。"},{"id":"zhouyi-03-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-03","order":5,"text":"六四：乘马班如，求婚媾。往，吉。无不利。"},{"id":"zhouyi-03-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-03","order":6,"text":"九五：屯其膏。小贞吉；大贞凶。"},{"id":"zhouyi-03-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-03","order":7,"text":"上六：乘马班如，泣血涟如。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-04","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"蒙卦","order":4,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-04-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-04","order":1,"text":"《蒙》：亨。匪我求童蒙，童蒙求我；初筮告，再三渎，渎则不告。利贞。"},{"id":"zhouyi-04-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-04","order":2,"text":"初六：发蒙，利用刑人。用说桎梏，以往吝。"},{"id":"zhouyi-04-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-04","order":3,"text":"九二：包蒙，吉。纳妇，吉。子克家。"},{"id":"zhouyi-04-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-04","order":4,"text":"六三：勿用取女，见金夫，不有躬。无攸利。"},{"id":"zhouyi-04-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-04","order":5,"text":"六四：困蒙，吝。"},{"id":"zhouyi-04-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-04","order":6,"text":"六五：童蒙，吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-04-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-04","order":7,"text":"上九：击蒙，不利为寇，利御寇。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-05","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"需卦","order":5,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-05-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-05","order":1,"text":"《需》：有孚，光亨，贞吉。利涉大川。"},{"id":"zhouyi-05-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-05","order":2,"text":"初九：需于郊，利用恒，无咎。"},{"id":"zhouyi-05-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-05","order":3,"text":"九二：需于沙，小有言，终吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-05-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-05","order":4,"text":"九三：需于泥，致寇至。"},{"id":"zhouyi-05-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-05","order":5,"text":"六四：需于血，出自穴。"},{"id":"zhouyi-05-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-05","order":6,"text":"九五：需于酒食，贞吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-05-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-05","order":7,"text":"上六：入于穴，有不速之客三人来，敬之，终吉。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-06","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"讼卦","order":6,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-06-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-06","order":1,"text":"《讼》：有孚窒惕，中吉；终凶，利见大人，不利涉大川。"},{"id":"zhouyi-06-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-06","order":2,"text":"初六：不永所事，小有言，终吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-06-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-06","order":3,"text":"九二：不克讼，归而逋，其邑人三百户。无眚。"},{"id":"zhouyi-06-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-06","order":4,"text":"六三：食旧德，贞厉，终吉；或从王事，无成。"},{"id":"zhouyi-06-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-06","order":5,"text":"九四：不克讼，复即命，渝。安贞，吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-06-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-06","order":6,"text":"九五：讼，元吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-06-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-06","order":7,"text":"上九：或锡之鞶带，终朝三褫之。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-07","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"师卦","order":7,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-07-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-07","order":1,"text":"师：贞，丈人吉，无咎。"},{"id":"zhouyi-07-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-07","order":2,"text":"初六：师出以律，否臧凶。"},{"id":"zhouyi-07-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-07","order":3,"text":"九二：在师中，吉，无咎。王三锡命。"},{"id":"zhouyi-07-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-07","order":4,"text":"六三：师或舆尸，凶。"},{"id":"zhouyi-07-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-07","order":5,"text":"六四：师左次，无咎。"},{"id":"zhouyi-07-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-07","order":6,"text":"六五：田有禽，利执言，无咎。长子帅师，弟子舆尸，贞凶。"},{"id":"zhouyi-07-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-07","order":7,"text":"上六：大君有命，开国承家，小人勿用。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-08","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"比卦","order":8,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-08-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-08","order":1,"text":"比：吉。原筮，元永贞。无咎。不宁方来，后夫凶。"},{"id":"zhouyi-08-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-08","order":2,"text":"初六：有孚比之，无咎。有孚盈缶，终来。有它，吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-08-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-08","order":3,"text":"六二：比之自内，贞吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-08-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-08","order":4,"text":"六三：比之匪人。"},{"id":"zhouyi-08-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-08","order":5,"text":"六四：外比之，贞吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-08-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-08","order":6,"text":"九五：显比；王用三驱，失前禽，邑人不诫，吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-08-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-08","order":7,"text":"上六：比之无首，凶。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-09","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"小畜卦","order":9,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-09-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-09","order":1,"text":"小畜：亨。密云不雨，自我西郊。"},{"id":"zhouyi-09-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-09","order":2,"text":"初九：复自道，何其咎？吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-09-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-09","order":3,"text":"九二：牵复，吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-09-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-09","order":4,"text":"九三：舆说辐，夫妻反目。"},{"id":"zhouyi-09-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-09","order":5,"text":"六四：有孚，血去惕出，无咎。"},{"id":"zhouyi-09-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-09","order":6,"text":"九五：有孚挛如，富以其邻。"},{"id":"zhouyi-09-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-09","order":7,"text":"上九：既雨既处，尚德载；妇贞厉，月几望；君子征凶。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-10","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"履卦","order":10,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-10-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-10","order":1,"text":"履：履虎尾，不咥人，亨。"},{"id":"zhouyi-10-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-10","order":2,"text":"初九：素履，往无咎。"},{"id":"zhouyi-10-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-10","order":3,"text":"九二：履道坦坦，幽人贞吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-10-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-10","order":4,"text":"六三：眇能视，跛能履，履虎尾咥人，凶。武人为于大君。"},{"id":"zhouyi-10-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-10","order":5,"text":"九四：履虎尾，愬愬，终吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-10-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-10","order":6,"text":"九五：夬履，贞厉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-10-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-10","order":7,"text":"上九：视履考祥，其旋元吉。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-11","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"泰卦","order":11,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-11-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-11","order":1,"text":"泰：小往大来，吉亨。"},{"id":"zhouyi-11-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-11","order":2,"text":"初九：拔茅茹，以其汇；征吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-11-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-11","order":3,"text":"九二：包荒，用冯河，不遐遗。朋亡，得尚于中行。"},{"id":"zhouyi-11-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-11","order":4,"text":"九三：无平不陂，无往不复。艰贞无咎。勿恤其孚，于食有福。"},{"id":"zhouyi-11-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-11","order":5,"text":"六四：翩翩，不富，以其邻不戒以孚。"},{"id":"zhouyi-11-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-11","order":6,"text":"六五：帝乙归妹，以祉元吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-11-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-11","order":7,"text":"上六：城复于隍。勿用师，自邑告命。贞吝。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-12","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"否卦","order":12,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-12-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-12","order":1,"text":"否：否之匪人，不利，君子贞；大往小来。"},{"id":"zhouyi-12-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-12","order":2,"text":"初六：拔茅茹，以其汇；贞吉，亨。"},{"id":"zhouyi-12-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-12","order":3,"text":"六二：包承，小人吉；大人否，亨。"},{"id":"zhouyi-12-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-12","order":4,"text":"六三：包羞。"},{"id":"zhouyi-12-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-12","order":5,"text":"九四：有命无咎，畴离祉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-12-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-12","order":6,"text":"九五：休否，大人吉；其亡其亡，系于苞桑。"},{"id":"zhouyi-12-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-12","order":7,"text":"上九：倾否；先否后喜。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-13","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"同人卦","order":13,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-13-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-13","order":1,"text":"同人：同人于野，亨，利涉大川，利君子贞。"},{"id":"zhouyi-13-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-13","order":2,"text":"初九：同人于门，无咎。"},{"id":"zhouyi-13-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-13","order":3,"text":"六二：同人于宗，吝。"},{"id":"zhouyi-13-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-13","order":4,"text":"九三：伏戎于莽，升其高陵，三岁不兴。"},{"id":"zhouyi-13-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-13","order":5,"text":"九四：乘其墉，弗克攻，吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-13-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-13","order":6,"text":"九五：同人，先号咷，而后笑，大师克相遇。"},{"id":"zhouyi-13-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-13","order":7,"text":"上九：同人于郊，无悔。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-14","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"大有卦","order":14,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-14-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-14","order":1,"text":"大有：元亨。"},{"id":"zhouyi-14-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-14","order":2,"text":"初九：无交害，匪咎；艰则无咎。"},{"id":"zhouyi-14-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-14","order":3,"text":"九二：大车以载，有攸往，无咎。"},{"id":"zhouyi-14-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-14","order":4,"text":"九三：公用亨于天子。小人弗克。"},{"id":"zhouyi-14-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-14","order":5,"text":"九四：匪其彭，无咎。"},{"id":"zhouyi-14-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-14","order":6,"text":"六五：厥孚交如，威如，吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-14-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-14","order":7,"text":"上九：自天祐之，吉无不利。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-15","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"谦卦","order":15,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-15-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-15","order":1,"text":"谦：亨。君子有终。"},{"id":"zhouyi-15-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-15","order":2,"text":"初六：谦谦君子。用涉大川，吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-15-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-15","order":3,"text":"六二：鸣谦，贞吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-15-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-15","order":4,"text":"九三：劳谦，君子有终，吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-15-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-15","order":5,"text":"六四：无不利，捴谦。"},{"id":"zhouyi-15-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-15","order":6,"text":"六五：不富，以其邻利用侵伐，无不利。"},{"id":"zhouyi-15-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-15","order":7,"text":"上六：鸣谦，利用行师、征邑国。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-16","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"豫卦","order":16,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-16-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-16","order":1,"text":"豫：利建侯，行师。"},{"id":"zhouyi-16-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-16","order":2,"text":"初六：鸣豫，凶。"},{"id":"zhouyi-16-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-16","order":3,"text":"六二：介于石，不终日，贞吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-16-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-16","order":4,"text":"六三：盱豫悔；迟有悔。"},{"id":"zhouyi-16-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-16","order":5,"text":"九四：由豫，大有得，勿疑。朋盍簪。"},{"id":"zhouyi-16-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-16","order":6,"text":"六五：贞疾，恒不死。"},{"id":"zhouyi-16-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-16","order":7,"text":"上六：冥豫，成有渝，无咎。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-17","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"随卦","order":17,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-17-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-17","order":1,"text":"随：元亨，利贞，无咎。"},{"id":"zhouyi-17-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-17","order":2,"text":"初九：官有渝，贞吉。出门交有功。"},{"id":"zhouyi-17-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-17","order":3,"text":"六二：系小子，失丈夫。"},{"id":"zhouyi-17-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-17","order":4,"text":"六三：系丈夫，失小子；随有求得，利居贞。"},{"id":"zhouyi-17-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-17","order":5,"text":"九四：随有获，贞凶；有孚在道，以明，何咎。"},{"id":"zhouyi-17-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-17","order":6,"text":"九五：孚于嘉，吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-17-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-17","order":7,"text":"上六：拘系之，乃从，维之；王用亨于西山。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-18","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"蛊卦","order":18,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-18-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-18","order":1,"text":"蛊：元亨。利涉大川；先甲三日，后甲三日。"},{"id":"zhouyi-18-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-18","order":2,"text":"初六：干父之蛊，有子考无咎，厉终吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-18-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-18","order":3,"text":"九二：干母之蛊，不可贞。"},{"id":"zhouyi-18-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-18","order":4,"text":"九三：干父之蛊，小有悔，无大咎。"},{"id":"zhouyi-18-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-18","order":5,"text":"六四：裕父之蛊，往见吝。"},{"id":"zhouyi-18-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-18","order":6,"text":"六五：干父之蛊，用誉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-18-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-18","order":7,"text":"上九：不事王侯，高尚其事。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-19","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"临卦","order":19,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-19-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-19","order":1,"text":"《临》：元，亨，利，贞。至于八月有凶。"},{"id":"zhouyi-19-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-19","order":2,"text":"初九：咸临，贞吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-19-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-19","order":3,"text":"九二：咸临，吉无不利。"},{"id":"zhouyi-19-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-19","order":4,"text":"六三：甘临，无攸利。既忧之，无咎。"},{"id":"zhouyi-19-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-19","order":5,"text":"六四：至临，无咎。"},{"id":"zhouyi-19-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-19","order":6,"text":"六五：知临，大君之宜，吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-19-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-19","order":7,"text":"上六：敦临，吉无咎。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-20","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"观卦","order":20,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-20-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-20","order":1,"text":"《观》：盥而不荐。有孚顒若。"},{"id":"zhouyi-20-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-20","order":2,"text":"初六：童观，小人无咎，君子吝。"},{"id":"zhouyi-20-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-20","order":3,"text":"六二：窥观，利女贞。"},{"id":"zhouyi-20-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-20","order":4,"text":"六三：观我生，进退。"},{"id":"zhouyi-20-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-20","order":5,"text":"六四：观国之光，利用宾于王。"},{"id":"zhouyi-20-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-20","order":6,"text":"九五：观我生，君子无咎。"},{"id":"zhouyi-20-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-20","order":7,"text":"上九：观其生，君子无咎。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-21","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"噬嗑卦","order":21,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-21-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-21","order":1,"text":"《噬嗑》：亨。利用狱。"},{"id":"zhouyi-21-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-21","order":2,"text":"初九：屦校灭趾，无咎。"},{"id":"zhouyi-21-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-21","order":3,"text":"六二：噬肤灭鼻，无咎。"},{"id":"zhouyi-21-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-21","order":4,"text":"六三：噬腊肉，遇毒；小吝，无咎。"},{"id":"zhouyi-21-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-21","order":5,"text":"九四：噬干胏，得金矢，利艰贞，吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-21-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-21","order":6,"text":"六五：噬乾肉，得黄金，贞厉，无咎。"},{"id":"zhouyi-21-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-21","order":7,"text":"上九：何校灭耳，凶。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-22","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"贲卦","order":22,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-22-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-22","order":1,"text":"《贲》：亨。小利有攸往。"},{"id":"zhouyi-22-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-22","order":2,"text":"初九：贲其趾，舍车而徒。"},{"id":"zhouyi-22-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-22","order":3,"text":"六二：贲其须。"},{"id":"zhouyi-22-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-22","order":4,"text":"九三：贲如濡如，永贞吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-22-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-22","order":5,"text":"六四：贲如皤如，白马翰如，匪寇婚媾。"},{"id":"zhouyi-22-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-22","order":6,"text":"六五：贲于丘园，束帛戋戋，吝，终吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-22-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-22","order":7,"text":"上九：白贲，无咎。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-23","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"剥卦","order":23,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-23-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-23","order":1,"text":"《剥》：不利有攸往。"},{"id":"zhouyi-23-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-23","order":2,"text":"初六：剥床以足，蔑贞凶。"},{"id":"zhouyi-23-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-23","order":3,"text":"六二：剥床以辨，蔑贞凶。"},{"id":"zhouyi-23-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-23","order":4,"text":"六三：剥之，无咎。"},{"id":"zhouyi-23-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-23","order":5,"text":"六四：剥床以肤，凶。"},{"id":"zhouyi-23-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-23","order":6,"text":"六五：贯鱼，以宫人宠，无不利。"},{"id":"zhouyi-23-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-23","order":7,"text":"上九：硕果不食，君子得舆，小人剥庐。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-24","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"复卦","order":24,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-24-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-24","order":1,"text":"《复》：亨。出入无疾，朋来无咎。反覆其道，七日来复，利有攸往。"},{"id":"zhouyi-24-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-24","order":2,"text":"初九：不远复，无祗悔，元吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-24-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-24","order":3,"text":"六二：休复，吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-24-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-24","order":4,"text":"六三：频复，厉无咎。"},{"id":"zhouyi-24-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-24","order":5,"text":"六四：中行独复。"},{"id":"zhouyi-24-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-24","order":6,"text":"六五：敦复，无悔。"},{"id":"zhouyi-24-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-24","order":7,"text":"上六：迷复，凶，有灾眚。用行师，终有大败，以其国君，凶；至于十年，不克征。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-25","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"无妄卦","order":25,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-25-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-25","order":1,"text":"《无妄》：元，亨，利，贞。其匪正有眚，不利有攸往。"},{"id":"zhouyi-25-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-25","order":2,"text":"初九：无妄，往吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-25-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-25","order":3,"text":"六二：不耕获，不菑畲，则利用攸往。"},{"id":"zhouyi-25-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-25","order":4,"text":"六三：无妄之灾，或系之牛，行人之得，邑人之灾。"},{"id":"zhouyi-25-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-25","order":5,"text":"九四：可贞。无咎。"},{"id":"zhouyi-25-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-25","order":6,"text":"九五：无妄之疾，勿药有喜。"},{"id":"zhouyi-25-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-25","order":7,"text":"上九：无妄，行有眚，无攸利。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-26","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"大畜卦","order":26,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-26-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-26","order":1,"text":"《大畜》：利贞，不家食吉，利涉大川。"},{"id":"zhouyi-26-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-26","order":2,"text":"初九：有厉利已。"},{"id":"zhouyi-26-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-26","order":3,"text":"九二：舆说輹。"},{"id":"zhouyi-26-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-26","order":4,"text":"九三：良马逐，利艰贞。曰闲舆卫，利有攸往。"},{"id":"zhouyi-26-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-26","order":5,"text":"六四：童牛之牿，元吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-26-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-26","order":6,"text":"六五：豶豕之牙，吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-26-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-26","order":7,"text":"上九：何天之衢，亨。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-27","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"颐卦","order":27,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-27-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-27","order":1,"text":"《颐》：贞吉。观颐，自求口实。"},{"id":"zhouyi-27-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-27","order":2,"text":"初九：舍尔灵龟，观我朵颐，凶。"},{"id":"zhouyi-27-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-27","order":3,"text":"六二：颠颐，拂经，于丘颐，征凶。"},{"id":"zhouyi-27-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-27","order":4,"text":"六三：拂颐，贞凶，十年勿用，无攸利。"},{"id":"zhouyi-27-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-27","order":5,"text":"六四：颠颐吉，虎视眈眈，其欲逐逐，无咎。"},{"id":"zhouyi-27-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-27","order":6,"text":"六五：拂经，居贞吉，不可涉大川。"},{"id":"zhouyi-27-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-27","order":7,"text":"上九：由颐，厉吉，利涉大川。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-28","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"大过卦","order":28,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-28-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-28","order":1,"text":"《大过》：栋挠，利有攸往，亨。"},{"id":"zhouyi-28-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-28","order":2,"text":"初六：藉用白茅，无咎。"},{"id":"zhouyi-28-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-28","order":3,"text":"九二：枯杨生稊，老夫得其女妻，无不利。"},{"id":"zhouyi-28-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-28","order":4,"text":"九三：栋桡，凶。"},{"id":"zhouyi-28-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-28","order":5,"text":"九四：栋隆，吉；有它吝。"},{"id":"zhouyi-28-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-28","order":6,"text":"九五：枯杨生华，老妇得其士夫，无咎无誉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-28-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-28","order":7,"text":"上六：过涉灭顶，凶，无咎。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-29","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"坎卦","order":29,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-29-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-29","order":1,"text":"《坎坎》：有孚，维心亨，行有尚。"},{"id":"zhouyi-29-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-29","order":2,"text":"初六：习坎，入于坎窞，凶。"},{"id":"zhouyi-29-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-29","order":3,"text":"九二：坎有险，求小得。"},{"id":"zhouyi-29-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-29","order":4,"text":"六三：来之坎，坎险且枕，入于坎窞，勿用。"},{"id":"zhouyi-29-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-29","order":5,"text":"六四：樽酒簋贰，用缶，纳约自牖，终无咎。"},{"id":"zhouyi-29-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-29","order":6,"text":"九五：坎不盈，祗既平，无咎。"},{"id":"zhouyi-29-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-29","order":7,"text":"上六：系用徽纆，窴于丛棘，三岁不得，凶。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-30","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"离卦","order":30,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-30-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-30","order":1,"text":"《离》：利贞，亨。畜牝牛，吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-30-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-30","order":2,"text":"初九：履错然，敬之无咎。"},{"id":"zhouyi-30-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-30","order":3,"text":"六二：黄离，元吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-30-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-30","order":4,"text":"九三：日昃之离，不鼓缶而歌，则大耋之嗟，凶。"},{"id":"zhouyi-30-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-30","order":5,"text":"九四：突如其来如，焚如，死如，弃如。"},{"id":"zhouyi-30-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-30","order":6,"text":"六五：出涕沱若，戚嗟若，吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-30-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-30","order":7,"text":"上九：王用出征，有嘉折首，获匪其丑，无咎。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-31","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"咸卦","order":31,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-31-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-31","order":1,"text":"《咸》：亨，利贞，取女吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-31-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-31","order":2,"text":"初六：咸其拇。"},{"id":"zhouyi-31-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-31","order":3,"text":"六二：咸其腓，凶，居吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-31-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-31","order":4,"text":"九三：咸其股，执其随，往吝。"},{"id":"zhouyi-31-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-31","order":5,"text":"九四：贞吉悔亡，憧憧往来，朋从尔思。"},{"id":"zhouyi-31-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-31","order":6,"text":"九五：咸其脢，无悔。"},{"id":"zhouyi-31-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-31","order":7,"text":"上六：咸其辅，颊，舌。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-32","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"恒卦","order":32,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-32-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-32","order":1,"text":"《恒》：亨，无咎，利贞，利有攸往。"},{"id":"zhouyi-32-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-32","order":2,"text":"初六：浚恒，贞凶，无攸利。"},{"id":"zhouyi-32-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-32","order":3,"text":"九二：悔亡。"},{"id":"zhouyi-32-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-32","order":4,"text":"九三：不恒其德，或承之羞，贞吝。"},{"id":"zhouyi-32-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-32","order":5,"text":"九四：田无禽。"},{"id":"zhouyi-32-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-32","order":6,"text":"六五：恒其德，贞，妇人吉，夫子凶。"},{"id":"zhouyi-32-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-32","order":7,"text":"上六：振恒，凶。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-33","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"遯卦","order":33,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-33-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-33","order":1,"text":"《遯》：亨，小利贞。"},{"id":"zhouyi-33-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-33","order":2,"text":"初六：遯尾，厉，勿用有攸往。"},{"id":"zhouyi-33-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-33","order":3,"text":"六二：执之用黄牛之革，莫之胜说。"},{"id":"zhouyi-33-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-33","order":4,"text":"九三：系遯，有疾厉，畜臣妾吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-33-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-33","order":5,"text":"九四：好遯君子吉，小人否。"},{"id":"zhouyi-33-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-33","order":6,"text":"九五：嘉遯，贞吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-33-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-33","order":7,"text":"上九：肥遯，无不利。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-34","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"大壮卦","order":34,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-34-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-34","order":1,"text":"《大壮》：利贞。"},{"id":"zhouyi-34-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-34","order":2,"text":"初九：壮于趾，征凶，有孚。"},{"id":"zhouyi-34-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-34","order":3,"text":"九二：贞吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-34-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-34","order":4,"text":"九三：小人用壮，君子用罔，贞厉。羝羊触藩，羸其角。"},{"id":"zhouyi-34-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-34","order":5,"text":"九四：贞吉，悔亡。藩决不羸，壮于大舆之輹。"},{"id":"zhouyi-34-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-34","order":6,"text":"六五：丧羊于易，无悔。"},{"id":"zhouyi-34-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-34","order":7,"text":"上六：羝羊触藩，不能退，不能遂，无攸利，艰则吉。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-35","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"晋卦","order":35,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-35-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-35","order":1,"text":"《晋》：康侯用锡马蕃庶，昼日三接。"},{"id":"zhouyi-35-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-35","order":2,"text":"初六：晋如，摧如，贞吉。罔孚，裕无咎。"},{"id":"zhouyi-35-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-35","order":3,"text":"六二：晋如，愁如，贞吉。受兹介福于，其王母。"},{"id":"zhouyi-35-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-35","order":4,"text":"六三：众允，悔亡。"},{"id":"zhouyi-35-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-35","order":5,"text":"九四：晋如鼫鼠，贞厉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-35-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-35","order":6,"text":"六五：悔亡，失得勿恤，往吉无不利。"},{"id":"zhouyi-35-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-35","order":7,"text":"上九：晋其角，维用伐邑，厉吉无咎，贞吝。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-36","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"明夷卦","order":36,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-36-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-36","order":1,"text":"《明夷》：利艰贞。"},{"id":"zhouyi-36-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-36","order":2,"text":"初九：明夷于飞，垂其翼。君子于行，三日不食，有攸往，主人有言。"},{"id":"zhouyi-36-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-36","order":3,"text":"六二：明夷，夷于左股，用拯马壮，吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-36-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-36","order":4,"text":"九三：明夷于南狩，得其大首，不可疾贞。"},{"id":"zhouyi-36-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-36","order":5,"text":"六四：入于左腹，获明夷之心，于出门庭。"},{"id":"zhouyi-36-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-36","order":6,"text":"六五：箕子之明夷，利贞。"},{"id":"zhouyi-36-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-36","order":7,"text":"上六：不明晦，初登于天，后入于地。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-37","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"家人卦","order":37,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-37-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-37","order":1,"text":"《家人》：利女贞。"},{"id":"zhouyi-37-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-37","order":2,"text":"初九：闲有家，悔亡。"},{"id":"zhouyi-37-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-37","order":3,"text":"六二：无攸遂，在中馈，贞吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-37-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-37","order":4,"text":"九三：家人嗃嗃，悔厉吉；妇子嘻嘻，终吝。"},{"id":"zhouyi-37-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-37","order":5,"text":"六四：富家，大吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-37-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-37","order":6,"text":"九五：王假有家，勿恤，吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-37-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-37","order":7,"text":"上九：有孚威如，终吉。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-38","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"睽卦","order":38,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-38-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-38","order":1,"text":"《睽》：小事吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-38-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-38","order":2,"text":"初九：悔亡，丧马勿逐，自复；见恶人无咎。"},{"id":"zhouyi-38-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-38","order":3,"text":"九二：遇主于巷，无咎。"},{"id":"zhouyi-38-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-38","order":4,"text":"六三：见舆曳，其牛掣，其人天且劓，无初有终。"},{"id":"zhouyi-38-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-38","order":5,"text":"九四：睽孤，遇元夫，交孚，厉无咎。"},{"id":"zhouyi-38-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-38","order":6,"text":"六五：悔亡，厥宗噬肤，往何咎？"},{"id":"zhouyi-38-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-38","order":7,"text":"上九：睽孤，见豕负涂，载鬼一车，先张之弧，后说之弧，匪寇婚媾，往遇雨则吉。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-39","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"蹇卦","order":39,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-39-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-39","order":1,"text":"《蹇》：利西南，不利东北；利见大人，贞吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-39-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-39","order":2,"text":"初六：往蹇，来誉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-39-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-39","order":3,"text":"六二：王臣蹇蹇，匪躬之故。"},{"id":"zhouyi-39-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-39","order":4,"text":"九三：往蹇来反。"},{"id":"zhouyi-39-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-39","order":5,"text":"六四：往蹇来连。"},{"id":"zhouyi-39-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-39","order":6,"text":"九五：大蹇朋来。"},{"id":"zhouyi-39-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-39","order":7,"text":"上六：往蹇来硕，吉；利见大人。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-40","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"解卦","order":40,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-40-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-40","order":1,"text":"《解》：利西南，无所往，其来复吉。有攸往，夙吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-40-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-40","order":2,"text":"初六：无咎。"},{"id":"zhouyi-40-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-40","order":3,"text":"九二：田获三狐，得黄矢，贞吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-40-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-40","order":4,"text":"六三：负且乘，致寇至，贞吝。"},{"id":"zhouyi-40-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-40","order":5,"text":"九四：解而拇，朋至斯孚。"},{"id":"zhouyi-40-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-40","order":6,"text":"六五：君子维有解，吉；有孚于小人。"},{"id":"zhouyi-40-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-40","order":7,"text":"上六：公用射隼，于高墉之上，获之，无不利。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-41","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"损卦","order":41,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-41-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-41","order":1,"text":"《损》：有孚，元吉，无咎，可贞，利有攸往？曷之用，二簋可用享。"},{"id":"zhouyi-41-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-41","order":2,"text":"初九：已事遄往，无咎。酌损之。"},{"id":"zhouyi-41-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-41","order":3,"text":"九二：利贞，征凶，弗损益之。"},{"id":"zhouyi-41-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-41","order":4,"text":"六三：三人行，则损一人；一人行，则得其友。"},{"id":"zhouyi-41-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-41","order":5,"text":"六四：损其疾，使遄有喜，无咎。"},{"id":"zhouyi-41-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-41","order":6,"text":"六五：或益之，十朋之龟弗克违，元吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-41-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-41","order":7,"text":"上九：弗损益之，无咎，贞吉，利有攸往，得臣无家。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-42","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"益卦","order":42,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-42-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-42","order":1,"text":"《益》：利有攸往，利涉大川。"},{"id":"zhouyi-42-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-42","order":2,"text":"初九：利用为大作，元吉，无咎。"},{"id":"zhouyi-42-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-42","order":3,"text":"六二：或益之，十朋之龟弗克违，永贞吉。王用享于帝，吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-42-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-42","order":4,"text":"六三：益之用凶事，无咎。有孚中行，告公用圭。"},{"id":"zhouyi-42-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-42","order":5,"text":"六四：中行，告公从。利用为依迁国。"},{"id":"zhouyi-42-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-42","order":6,"text":"九五：有孚惠心，勿问元吉。有孚惠我德。"},{"id":"zhouyi-42-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-42","order":7,"text":"上九：莫益之，或击之，立心勿恒，凶。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-43","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"夬卦","order":43,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-43-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-43","order":1,"text":"《夬》：扬于王庭，孚号，有厉，告自邑，不利即戎，利有攸往。"},{"id":"zhouyi-43-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-43","order":2,"text":"初九：壮于前趾，往不胜为咎。"},{"id":"zhouyi-43-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-43","order":3,"text":"九二：惕号，莫夜有戎，勿恤。"},{"id":"zhouyi-43-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-43","order":4,"text":"九三：壮于頄，有凶。君子夬夬，独行遇雨，若濡有愠，无咎。"},{"id":"zhouyi-43-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-43","order":5,"text":"九四：臀无肤，其行次且。牵羊悔亡，闻言不信。"},{"id":"zhouyi-43-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-43","order":6,"text":"九五：苋陆夬夬，中行无咎。"},{"id":"zhouyi-43-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-43","order":7,"text":"上六：无号，终有凶。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-44","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"姤卦","order":44,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-44-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-44","order":1,"text":"《姤》：女壮，勿用取女。"},{"id":"zhouyi-44-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-44","order":2,"text":"初六：系于金柅，贞吉，有攸往，见凶，羸豕孚蹢躅。"},{"id":"zhouyi-44-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-44","order":3,"text":"九二：包有鱼，无咎，不利宾。"},{"id":"zhouyi-44-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-44","order":4,"text":"九三：臀无肤，其行次且，厉，无大咎。"},{"id":"zhouyi-44-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-44","order":5,"text":"九四：包无鱼，起凶。"},{"id":"zhouyi-44-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-44","order":6,"text":"九五：以杞包瓜，含章，有陨自天。"},{"id":"zhouyi-44-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-44","order":7,"text":"上九：姤其角，吝，无咎。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-45","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"萃卦","order":45,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-45-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-45","order":1,"text":"《萃》：亨。王假有庙，利见大人，亨，利贞。用大牲吉，利有攸往。"},{"id":"zhouyi-45-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-45","order":2,"text":"初六：有孚不终，乃乱乃萃，若号一握为笑，勿恤，往无咎。"},{"id":"zhouyi-45-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-45","order":3,"text":"六二：引吉，无咎，孚乃利用禴。"},{"id":"zhouyi-45-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-45","order":4,"text":"六三：萃如，嗟如，无攸利，往无咎，小吝。"},{"id":"zhouyi-45-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-45","order":5,"text":"九四：大吉，无咎。"},{"id":"zhouyi-45-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-45","order":6,"text":"九五：萃有位，无咎。匪孚，元永贞，悔亡。"},{"id":"zhouyi-45-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-45","order":7,"text":"上六：赍咨涕洟，无咎。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-46","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"升卦","order":46,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-46-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-46","order":1,"text":"《升》：元亨，用见大人，勿恤，南征吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-46-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-46","order":2,"text":"初六：允升，大吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-46-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-46","order":3,"text":"九二：孚乃利用禴，无咎。"},{"id":"zhouyi-46-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-46","order":4,"text":"九三：升虚邑。"},{"id":"zhouyi-46-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-46","order":5,"text":"六四：王用亨于岐山，吉无咎。"},{"id":"zhouyi-46-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-46","order":6,"text":"六五：贞吉，升阶。"},{"id":"zhouyi-46-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-46","order":7,"text":"上六：冥升，利于不息之贞。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-47","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"困卦","order":47,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-47-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-47","order":1,"text":"《困》：亨，贞，大人吉，无咎，有言不信。"},{"id":"zhouyi-47-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-47","order":2,"text":"初六：臀困于株木，入于幽谷，三岁不觌。"},{"id":"zhouyi-47-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-47","order":3,"text":"九二：困于酒食，朱绂方来，利用享祀，征凶，无咎。"},{"id":"zhouyi-47-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-47","order":4,"text":"六三：困于石，据于蒺藜，入于其宫，不见其妻，凶。"},{"id":"zhouyi-47-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-47","order":5,"text":"九四：来徐徐，困于金车，吝，有终。"},{"id":"zhouyi-47-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-47","order":6,"text":"九五：劓刖，困于赤绂，乃徐有说，利用祭祀。"},{"id":"zhouyi-47-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-47","order":7,"text":"上六：困于葛藟，于臲卼，曰动悔。有悔，征吉。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-48","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"井卦","order":48,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-48-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-48","order":1,"text":"《井》：改邑不改井，无丧无得，往来井井。汔至，亦未繘井，羸其瓶，凶。"},{"id":"zhouyi-48-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-48","order":2,"text":"初六：井泥不食，旧井无禽。"},{"id":"zhouyi-48-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-48","order":3,"text":"九二：井谷射鲋，瓮敝漏。"},{"id":"zhouyi-48-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-48","order":4,"text":"九三：井渫不食，为我心恻，可用汲，王明，并受其福。"},{"id":"zhouyi-48-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-48","order":5,"text":"六四：井甃，无咎。"},{"id":"zhouyi-48-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-48","order":6,"text":"九五：井洌，寒泉食。"},{"id":"zhouyi-48-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-48","order":7,"text":"上六：井收勿幕，有孚元吉。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-49","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"革卦","order":49,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-49-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-49","order":1,"text":"《革》：已日乃孚，元亨利贞，悔亡。"},{"id":"zhouyi-49-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-49","order":2,"text":"初九：巩用黄牛之革。"},{"id":"zhouyi-49-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-49","order":3,"text":"六二：巳日乃革之，征吉，无咎。"},{"id":"zhouyi-49-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-49","order":4,"text":"九三：征凶，贞厉，革言三就，有孚。"},{"id":"zhouyi-49-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-49","order":5,"text":"九四：悔亡，有孚改命，吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-49-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-49","order":6,"text":"九五：大人虎变，未占有孚。"},{"id":"zhouyi-49-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-49","order":7,"text":"上六：君子豹变，小人革面，征凶，居贞吉。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-50","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"鼎卦","order":50,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-50-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-50","order":1,"text":"《鼎》：元吉，亨。"},{"id":"zhouyi-50-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-50","order":2,"text":"初六：鼎颠趾，利出否，得妾以其子，无咎。"},{"id":"zhouyi-50-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-50","order":3,"text":"九二：鼎有实，我仇有疾，不我能即，吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-50-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-50","order":4,"text":"九三：鼎耳革，其行塞，雉膏不食，方雨亏悔，终吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-50-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-50","order":5,"text":"九四：鼎折足，覆公餗，其形渥，凶。"},{"id":"zhouyi-50-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-50","order":6,"text":"六五：鼎黄耳金铉，利贞。"},{"id":"zhouyi-50-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-50","order":7,"text":"上九：鼎玉铉，大吉，无不利。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-51","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"震卦","order":51,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-51-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-51","order":1,"text":"《震》：亨。震来虩虩，笑言哑哑。震惊百里，不丧匕鬯。"},{"id":"zhouyi-51-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-51","order":2,"text":"初九：震来虩虩，后笑言哑哑，吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-51-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-51","order":3,"text":"六二：震来厉，亿丧贝，跻于九陵，勿逐，七日得。"},{"id":"zhouyi-51-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-51","order":4,"text":"六三：震苏苏，震行无眚。"},{"id":"zhouyi-51-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-51","order":5,"text":"九四：震遂泥。"},{"id":"zhouyi-51-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-51","order":6,"text":"六五：震往来厉，意无丧，有事。"},{"id":"zhouyi-51-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-51","order":7,"text":"上六：震索索，视矍矍，征凶。震不于其躬，于其邻，无咎。婚媾有言。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-52","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"艮卦","order":52,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-52-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-52","order":1,"text":"《艮》：艮其背，不获其身，行其庭，不见其人，无咎。"},{"id":"zhouyi-52-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-52","order":2,"text":"初六：艮其趾，无咎，利永贞。"},{"id":"zhouyi-52-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-52","order":3,"text":"六二：艮其腓，不拯其随，其心不快。"},{"id":"zhouyi-52-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-52","order":4,"text":"九三：艮其限，列其夤，厉熏心。"},{"id":"zhouyi-52-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-52","order":5,"text":"六四：艮其身，无咎。"},{"id":"zhouyi-52-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-52","order":6,"text":"六五：艮其辅，言有序，悔亡。"},{"id":"zhouyi-52-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-52","order":7,"text":"上九：敦艮，吉。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-53","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"渐卦","order":53,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-53-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-53","order":1,"text":"《渐》：女归吉，利贞。"},{"id":"zhouyi-53-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-53","order":2,"text":"初六：鸿渐于干，小子厉，有言，无咎。"},{"id":"zhouyi-53-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-53","order":3,"text":"六二：鸿渐于磐，饮食衎衎，吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-53-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-53","order":4,"text":"九三：鸿渐于陆，夫征不复，妇孕不育，凶；利御寇。"},{"id":"zhouyi-53-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-53","order":5,"text":"六四：鸿渐于木，或得其桷，无咎。"},{"id":"zhouyi-53-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-53","order":6,"text":"九五：鸿渐于陵，妇三岁不孕，终莫之胜，吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-53-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-53","order":7,"text":"上九：鸿渐于陆，其羽可用为仪，吉。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-54","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"归妹卦","order":54,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-54-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-54","order":1,"text":"《归妹》：征凶，无攸利。"},{"id":"zhouyi-54-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-54","order":2,"text":"初九：归妹以娣，跛能履，征吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-54-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-54","order":3,"text":"九二：眇能视，利幽人之贞。"},{"id":"zhouyi-54-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-54","order":4,"text":"六三：归妹以须，反归以娣。"},{"id":"zhouyi-54-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-54","order":5,"text":"九四：归妹愆期，迟归有时。"},{"id":"zhouyi-54-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-54","order":6,"text":"六五：帝乙归妹，其君之袂，不如其娣之袂良，月几望，吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-54-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-54","order":7,"text":"上六：女承筐无实，士刲羊无血，无攸利。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-55","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"丰卦","order":55,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-55-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-55","order":1,"text":"《丰》：亨，王假之，勿忧，宜日中。"},{"id":"zhouyi-55-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-55","order":2,"text":"初九：遇其配主，虽旬无咎，往有尚。"},{"id":"zhouyi-55-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-55","order":3,"text":"六二：丰其蔀，日中见斗，往得疑疾，有孚发若，吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-55-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-55","order":4,"text":"九三：丰其沛，日中见沫，折其右肱，无咎。"},{"id":"zhouyi-55-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-55","order":5,"text":"九四：丰其蔀，日中见斗，遇其夷主，吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-55-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-55","order":6,"text":"六五：来章，有庆誉，吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-55-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-55","order":7,"text":"上六：丰其屋，蔀其家，窥其户，阒其无人，三岁不觌，凶。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-56","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"旅卦","order":56,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-56-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-56","order":1,"text":"《旅》：小亨，旅贞吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-56-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-56","order":2,"text":"初六：旅琐琐，斯其所取灾。"},{"id":"zhouyi-56-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-56","order":3,"text":"六二：旅即次，怀其资，得童仆贞。"},{"id":"zhouyi-56-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-56","order":4,"text":"九三：旅焚其次，丧其童仆，贞厉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-56-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-56","order":5,"text":"九四：旅于处，得其资斧，我心不快。"},{"id":"zhouyi-56-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-56","order":6,"text":"六五：射雉一矢亡，终以誉命。"},{"id":"zhouyi-56-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-56","order":7,"text":"上九：鸟焚其巢，旅人先笑后号。丧牛于易，凶。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-57","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"巽卦","order":57,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-57-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-57","order":1,"text":"《巽》：小亨，利有攸往，利见大人。"},{"id":"zhouyi-57-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-57","order":2,"text":"初六：进退，利武人之贞。"},{"id":"zhouyi-57-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-57","order":3,"text":"九二：巽在床下，用史巫纷若吉，无咎。"},{"id":"zhouyi-57-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-57","order":4,"text":"九三：频巽，吝。"},{"id":"zhouyi-57-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-57","order":5,"text":"六四：悔亡，田获三品。"},{"id":"zhouyi-57-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-57","order":6,"text":"九五：贞吉悔亡，无不利。无初有终，先庚三日，后庚三日，吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-57-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-57","order":7,"text":"上九：巽在床下，丧其资斧，贞凶。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-58","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"兑卦","order":58,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-58-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-58","order":1,"text":"《兑》：亨，利贞。"},{"id":"zhouyi-58-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-58","order":2,"text":"初九：和兑，吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-58-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-58","order":3,"text":"九二：孚兑，吉，悔亡。"},{"id":"zhouyi-58-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-58","order":4,"text":"六三：来兑，凶。"},{"id":"zhouyi-58-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-58","order":5,"text":"九四：商兑，未宁，介疾有喜。"},{"id":"zhouyi-58-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-58","order":6,"text":"九五：孚于剥，有厉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-58-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-58","order":7,"text":"上六：引兑。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-59","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"涣卦","order":59,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-59-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-59","order":1,"text":"《涣》：亨。王假有庙，利涉大川，利贞。"},{"id":"zhouyi-59-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-59","order":2,"text":"初六：用拯马壮，吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-59-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-59","order":3,"text":"九二：涣奔其机，悔亡。"},{"id":"zhouyi-59-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-59","order":4,"text":"六三：涣其躬，无悔。"},{"id":"zhouyi-59-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-59","order":5,"text":"六四：涣其群，元吉。涣有丘，匪夷所思。"},{"id":"zhouyi-59-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-59","order":6,"text":"九五：涣汗其大号，涣王居，无咎。"},{"id":"zhouyi-59-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-59","order":7,"text":"上九：涣其血，去逖出，无咎。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-60","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"节卦","order":60,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-60-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-60","order":1,"text":"《节》：亨。苦节不可贞。"},{"id":"zhouyi-60-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-60","order":2,"text":"初九：不出户庭，无咎。"},{"id":"zhouyi-60-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-60","order":3,"text":"九二：不出门庭，凶。"},{"id":"zhouyi-60-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-60","order":4,"text":"六三：不节若，则嗟若，无咎。"},{"id":"zhouyi-60-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-60","order":5,"text":"六四：安节，亨。"},{"id":"zhouyi-60-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-60","order":6,"text":"九五：甘节，吉；往有尚。"},{"id":"zhouyi-60-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-60","order":7,"text":"上六：苦节，贞凶，悔亡。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-61","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"中孚卦","order":61,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-61-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-61","order":1,"text":"《中孚》：豚鱼吉，利涉大川，利贞。"},{"id":"zhouyi-61-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-61","order":2,"text":"初九：虞吉，有他不燕。"},{"id":"zhouyi-61-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-61","order":3,"text":"九二：鸣鹤在阴，其子和之，我有好爵，吾与尔靡之。"},{"id":"zhouyi-61-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-61","order":4,"text":"六三：得敌，或鼓或罢，或泣或歌。"},{"id":"zhouyi-61-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-61","order":5,"text":"六四：月几望，马匹亡，无咎。"},{"id":"zhouyi-61-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-61","order":6,"text":"九五：有孚挛如，无咎。"},{"id":"zhouyi-61-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-61","order":7,"text":"上九：翰音登于天，贞凶。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-62","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"小过卦","order":62,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-62-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-62","order":1,"text":"《小过》：亨，利贞，可小事，不可大事。飞鸟遗之音，不宜上宜下，大吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-62-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-62","order":2,"text":"初六：飞鸟以凶。"},{"id":"zhouyi-62-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-62","order":3,"text":"六二：过其祖，遇其妣；不及其君，遇其臣；无咎。"},{"id":"zhouyi-62-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-62","order":4,"text":"九三：弗过防之，从或戕之，凶。"},{"id":"zhouyi-62-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-62","order":5,"text":"九四：无咎，弗过遇之。往厉必戒，勿用永贞。"},{"id":"zhouyi-62-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-62","order":6,"text":"六五：密云不雨，自我西郊，公弋取彼在穴。"},{"id":"zhouyi-62-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-62","order":7,"text":"上六：弗遇过之，飞鸟离之，凶，是谓灾眚。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-63","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"既济卦","order":63,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-63-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-63","order":1,"text":"《既济》：亨，小利贞，初吉终乱。"},{"id":"zhouyi-63-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-63","order":2,"text":"初九：曳其轮，濡其尾，无咎。"},{"id":"zhouyi-63-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-63","order":3,"text":"六二：妇丧其茀，勿逐，七日得。"},{"id":"zhouyi-63-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-63","order":4,"text":"九三：高宗伐鬼方，三年克之，小人勿用。"},{"id":"zhouyi-63-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-63","order":5,"text":"六四：繻有衣袽，终日戒。"},{"id":"zhouyi-63-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-63","order":6,"text":"九五：东邻杀牛，不如西邻之禴祭，实受其福。"},{"id":"zhouyi-63-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-63","order":7,"text":"上六：濡其首，厉。"}]},{"id":"zhouyi-64","bookId":"zhouyi","title":"未济卦","order":64,"segments":[{"id":"zhouyi-64-1","chapterId":"zhouyi-64","order":1,"text":"《未济》：亨，小狐汔济，濡其尾，无攸利。"},{"id":"zhouyi-64-2","chapterId":"zhouyi-64","order":2,"text":"初六：濡其尾，吝。"},{"id":"zhouyi-64-3","chapterId":"zhouyi-64","order":3,"text":"九二：曳其轮，贞吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-64-4","chapterId":"zhouyi-64","order":4,"text":"六三：未济，征凶，利涉大川。"},{"id":"zhouyi-64-5","chapterId":"zhouyi-64","order":5,"text":"九四：贞吉，悔亡，震用伐鬼方，三年有赏于大国。"},{"id":"zhouyi-64-6","chapterId":"zhouyi-64","order":6,"text":"六五：贞吉，无悔，君子之光，有孚，吉。"},{"id":"zhouyi-64-7","chapterId":"zhouyi-64","order":7,"text":"上九：有孚于饮酒，无咎，濡其首，有孚失是。"}]}]}